{"case_id": "male_19710412_P005-Q23", "domain": "career", "question": "命主工作收入平均如何？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "### 推理分析\n\n命主八字为 **辛亥 壬辰 丁卯 戊申**，日主丁火生于辰月，辰为水库，月干透出壬水正官，官星当令有力。年柱辛亥，辛金偏财生助官星；时柱戊申，伤官生正财，财星有源。日坐卯木印星，化官生身，日主虽不得令，但有印星相生，属中和稍弱，喜木火扶持。\n\n从财官角度看，官星透出有根，偏财、正财俱见，伤官生财，财源不弱。命主中年以后大运走火土旺地（如丁亥、丙戌运），比劫帮身有力，足以担起财官。当前正值 **丙戌大运**（约2023-2032年），丙火劫财帮身，戌为火库暖局，身转旺，求财能力显著提升，事业财运正处于高峰期。\n\n结合台湾地区收入水平，50万新台币年薪属中等，100万属中上，150万以上则为高薪。该造财官有力，运助身强，格局组合良好，且年龄在职业生涯的巅峰期，应属高收入人群，年薪可超过150万新台币。\n\n### 最终答案\nD", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "male_19710412_P005-Q23", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1a_prime_R2_P2_G2\\details_2024_b1a_prime_R2_P2_G2.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 16987, "response_id": "04205de0-863f-43ca-8c6d-4f9d96253f60", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 225, "completion_tokens": 1067, "total_tokens": 1292, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 774}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 97}}
